sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Member in Slack
  participant S as Slack adapter
  participant H as Hugs
  participant B as Bus
  participant P as Progression
  participant L as Leaderboard
  participant Q as Quests
  participant A as Album
  M->>S: reacts with an emoji
  S->>H: mayReactWith(giver, emoji) query, via hypeEmojiFor (Q4)
  Note over S,B: no hype or kudos emoji: stop before any mutation
  S->>H: receiveReaction(reaction)
  H->>H: decide: hug, hype or nothing
  alt hug: giver holds the emoji, within budget and a day
    H->>H: insert the hug (one per giver and message)
    H->>B: hugGiven {giver, message, day, first}
    par one mutation per subscriber
      B->>P: hugGiven: hug XP, keyed hug-given:msg (Q1)
      P->>P: first-of-day bonus, keyed hug-day:giver:day (Q1)
    and
      B->>L: hugGiven: hugs given +1 in the giver's week
    and
      B->>A: hugGiven: a face-down find for the giver, ≤ rare, keyed hug-find:day (HH35)
    and
      B->>Q: hugGiven to fact {source: hug, action, people}
      Q-->>B: questFinished (when a quest completes)
    and
      B->>H: payHugPeople, 100 people a page (Q2)
      loop each person on the page
        H->>B: hugReceived {person, giver, message, week}
      end
    end
    par per person
      B->>P: hugReceived: hug XP + first-of-week bonus, keyed (Q1)
    and
      B->>L: hugReceived: hugs received +1 in the person's week
    end
  else hype: names a hype emoji the giver doesn't hold
    H->>B: hypeReacted {giver, owner, message}
    B->>A: hypeReacted: one row per giver, owner, message (Q4)
    Note over Q,A: the 10th row collects the emoji
  else nothing
    H-->>S: nothing, no write
  end
